<description>&lt;p&gt;The Cameroonian government has expanded its BIR rapid-intervention force around Lake Chad, deploying drones and joint border patrols to target Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest. Government troops killed four suspected separatists after a village attack, while a landmine near the border killed eight soldiers and police in Fundong were wounded in separate attacks. Issa Tchiroma’s party was suspended for three months. Cameroon also received a Metal Shark patrol boat to bolster maritime security. The UCDP recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBGT1RjejE5QkpYMlJkRm01ZWVLeWlBbnNtdGVBRUFVSHM1NXdPSnBPaDBfOWdqdklIVnZyNTBsOHR0YzZZZHlJcEhPcy05a1N6UFJfcHM4b29zbndoM0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1zRi14TlJJQ1VsVDdGemlzV2poSjBwbkR2VFI3T1N6bmE1b3FXazVveGtCQmFwSGxzZlZDMnNkc0xrYVFGUExqX0hwaVpmV0M2NXYtcU5YdV9JcVM1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNRGhBTnJocGFnVktOZVpuaWpaQWlNQzV1LXZWQ3pEM3NvQmttSnBGd2FtakhZWXlWdThUSDF1Zk5uX1JRVmlhdkwxdU1yRkpuTVBaaldCWWw5WVRGSU1NZzhvel9DZTBDVG1vcmE4dkNwa2VuZ1FtNGVSX2FleG9CbHJYZzg1REU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mining.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPWm55ZXFoN2Fmek0zZ25jZzJsbHA3M2NjRkdSZ0dtOHIydlhnN1RDSExZRHd6WTBvdWJtZUo2ZDVRdkhlaUR3MG9vbUhSdk5Iekk5QXdHNjlmQVRYNmVSajFZQlJQZkR2UDhQRzhEVW5vS2ZTdWxCeUp2VUdMN2pGZ0dzUmplWEF2?oc=5&quot;&gt;defenceWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQNm9jNzg4bm9XcEVaRFhPNGZBYWVUOFpuYzVkdFhpMjdJYUpVVTlBMUg3SEc0NEV2Z0FFZDYzUVRSUXRiRkVUbVZKb0RvVkcwLVFabXVQbTNTd1Z1OWhNeDN